## 3. 改动 diff（仅 Stage 1 可执行行 + 头注释；段序/段名/命令语义不变）
```diff
-# Root: publication-staging/execution-option-c-2159c657 (HEAD 613b6b40),
-# compiler pin 2159c657, input identity source-before1366 with its
-# retained itemized manifest (SOURCE_MANIFEST, provided by the invoker).
+# Root: selected at invocation time via $OPTION_C_ROOT (current
+# coordination run: execution-option-c-coord). Historical background
+# only, NOT this run's generation: the previous execution root
+# execution-option-c-2159c657 (HEAD 613b6b40, tree rebuilt at compiler
+# pin 2159c657) and the earlier identity source-before1366; the current
+# run's identity is attached dynamically by Stage 1 from $OPTION_C_ROOT
+# and $SOURCE_MANIFEST, plus a manifest-entry-count guard
+# (EXPECTED_MANIFEST_ENTRIES, default 1431).
-#   export OPTION_C_ROOT=<abs path to execution-option-c-2159c657>
-#   export SOURCE_MANIFEST=<abs path to the source-before1366 itemized manifest>
+#   export OPTION_C_ROOT=<abs path to the execution root, e.g.
+#                        execution-option-c-coord>
+#   export SOURCE_MANIFEST=<abs path to this run's itemized source manifest>
-# 1366-entry post-state check ALWAYS run (also after failures), and the
+# itemized-manifest post-state check (one entry per manifest line)
+# ALWAYS run (also after failures), and the
-# and ALL 1366 manifest entries are recomputed (sha256 + exec-bit)
+# and ALL manifest entries are recomputed (sha256 + exec-bit)
-bash -c 'cd "$1" && echo "compiler-pin=2159c657" && echo "source-reference=source-before1366" && echo "manifest-sha256=$(sha256sum "$SOURCE_MANIFEST" | cut -d" " -f1)" && cat "$SOURCE_MANIFEST"' _ "$OPTION_C_ROOT"
+bash -c 'cd "$1" && echo "compiler-pin=$(basename "$OPTION_C_ROOT")" && echo "source-reference=$(basename "$SOURCE_MANIFEST")" && echo "manifest-sha256=$(sha256sum "$SOURCE_MANIFEST" | cut -d" " -f1)" && expected=${EXPECTED_MANIFEST_ENTRIES:-1431} && actual=$(grep -c "\"path\"" "$SOURCE_MANIFEST") && { [ "$actual" = "$expected" ] || { echo "manifest-entry-count-mismatch: expected=$expected actual=$actual" >&2; exit 9; }; } && cat "$SOURCE_MANIFEST"' _ "$OPTION_C_ROOT"
```
